# SAINTCON 2023 Badge ("Incidents") headless smoke script
# Drives boot -> character registration -> main menu -> entering a dungeon -> battle

# 1. Boot splash screen + 8-LED ring chase (0..800 ms)
wait 260
shot-screen 01-boot
shot-badge 01b-boot-badge

# 2. Finish boot -> unregistered badge enters CharacterPicker ("Pick your avatar")
wait 1400
press right
wait 120
press a
wait 150

# Class picker ("Pick your class": Blue Team, Red Team, Social Engineer, Physical Security)
press down
press a
wait 150

# Handle & Email entry on EntryScreen 13x5 keypad
type-entry Player23
wait 150
type-entry p23@example.org
wait 400

# Insert virtual minibadges (Sword weapon, SCHoodie armor, Coffee usable item)
minibadge 1 Sword
minibadge 2 SCHoodie
minibadge 3 Coffee
wait 400

# 3. Main Menu screen (+ full PCB composite with Wi-Fi & minibadge slot LEDs)
shot-screen 02-main-screen
shot-badge 02b-main-badge

# 4. Select "Incidents" -> "Choose Incident" -> enter "1. Bot Training" (committee face dialogue)
press a
wait 350
press a
wait 450
shot-screen 03-enter-dungeon

# 5. Advance past intro dialogue into Battle against TrainingBot1
press a
wait 450
shot-screen 04-battle
shot-badge 04b-battle-badge

# Execute an Attack round in battle to verify /dungeon/battle & /dungeon/battle/update
press a
wait 220
shot-screen 04c-battle-attack
wait 1000
